263
00:10:47,721 --> 00:10:50,289
He's got a full scholarship to Ohio State.

264
00:10:50,340 --> 00:10:51,507
Nice to see you, too, Quinn.

265
00:10:51,592 --> 00:10:52,558
No, no, it's a good thing.

266
00:10:52,626 --> 00:10:54,293
See, I'm free, you're free.

267
00:10:54,344 --> 00:10:56,012
And I'm sure that you've noticed that I'm supermodel thin

268
00:10:56,096 --> 00:10:58,147 now that my thyroid is under control.

269
