+

288
00:11:50,399 --> 00:11:51,933 with the applications?
Deadlines are this week.

289
00:11:51,984 --> 00:11:54,969
Tina, I already applied to Stanford.

290
00:11:55,020 --> 00:11:55,987
Pre-med.

291
