Sir, girls smell better than ham

319
00:12:51,293 --> 00:12:52,910 and when they're dancing and bouncing around,

320
00:12:52,995 --> 00:12:53,995 you can't help but watch them.

321
00:12:54,046 --> 00:12:55,880
Well, that's it then.

322
00:12:55,964 --> 00:12:57,798
We'll take what's most appealing about us as a group,

323
00:12:57,866 --> 00:12:59,584 and we'll use it to our advantage.

324
00:12:59,668 --> 00:13:02,470
Yeah, how about, you know, something like, um...

325
00:13:02,537 --> 00:13:04,255 something like that?

326
00:13:04,339 --> 00:13:05,539
Cute!
I like the spin,
I like the spin.

327
00:13:05,591 --> 00:13:06,373
Try it again.

328
00:13:06,425 --> 00:13:07,558
Yeah.

329
00:13:07,643 --> 00:13:08,509
God, okay, stop, stop.

330
00:13:08,560 --> 00:13:09,927
Look, Blaine,

331
00:13:10,012 --> 00:13:12,563 this... is totally boy band.

332
00:13:12,648 --> 00:13:15,683
What we need to sell here is sex.

333
00:13:15,734 --> 00:13:17,101
What the hell is that?

334
00:13:17,186 --> 00:13:18,319
That's a, it's a body roll.

335
00:13:18,386 --> 00:13:19,437
It's not a body roll.

336
00:13:19,521 --> 00:13:22,389
That is sex.

337
00:13:25,393 --> 00:13:27,278
Man's not wrong.

338
00:13:27,362 --> 00:13:29,947
I got light tingles where it's only 50/50 for tingling.

339
00:13:30,032 --> 00:13:31,199
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Sam, that's awesome.

340
00:13:31,250 --> 00:13:32,617
That's exactly what we need.

341
