You know, it's selling out.

345
00:13:40,259 --> 00:13:41,626
I came back here to win.

346
00:13:41,710 --> 00:13:44,178
When you're desperate, sometimes you got to,

347
00:13:44,246 --> 00:13:45,763 you know, use your assets and do what you got to do

348
00:13:45,847 --> 00:13:46,747 to get back that advantage.

349
00:13:46,798 --> 00:13:49,433
This is the advantage.

350
00:13:49,518 --> 00:13:50,801
Of course that's what you think; you have to

351
