00:15:04,326 --> 00:15:06,294
An opportunity to be remembered at this school

379
00:15:06,345 --> 00:15:08,763 for the rest of our lives for doing the impossible.

380
00:15:08,830 --> 00:15:12,350
But it all starts right here, with you and me.

